    "detailed_description": "Explore the threads of fate and interpret the mists of the inner self. &quot;Guidelines for the Book of Changes&quot; lights your way forward. Deeply rooted in the philosophical wisdom of the ancient Chinese &quot;Book of Changes&quot;, this game perfectly blends classic hexagrams with modern interactive experiences, taking you on an extraordinary &quot;divination&quot; journey.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHere, money hexagrams are no longer simple predictions of good or bad luck, but a bridge for you to listen to yourself and gain insight into your inner world. Each cast of the hexagrams is a deep reflection on your life and a dialogue with your soul. We do not promote feudal superstitions, nor do we blindly worship fate. &quot;Guidelines for the Book of Changes&quot; aims to guide you in finding inner balance and strength amidst the complexities of life, navigating the unknown with wisdom and facing challenges with courage.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;Guidelines for the Book of Changes&quot; is not just a game, but a profound experience about oneself, life, and philosophical reflection. Now, let's embark on this journey together to explore the light within.",
    "about_the_game": "Explore the threads of fate and interpret the mists of the inner self. &quot;Guidelines for the Book of Changes&quot; lights your way forward. Deeply rooted in the philosophical wisdom of the ancient Chinese &quot;Book of Changes&quot;, this game perfectly blends classic hexagrams with modern interactive experiences, taking you on an extraordinary &quot;divination&quot; journey.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHere, money hexagrams are no longer simple predictions of good or bad luck, but a bridge for you to listen to yourself and gain insight into your inner world. Each cast of the hexagrams is a deep reflection on your life and a dialogue with your soul. We do not promote feudal superstitions, nor do we blindly worship fate. &quot;Guidelines for the Book of Changes&quot; aims to guide you in finding inner balance and strength amidst the complexities of life, navigating the unknown with wisdom and facing challenges with courage.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;Guidelines for the Book of Changes&quot; is not just a game, but a profound experience about oneself, life, and philosophical reflection. Now, let's embark on this journey together to explore the light within.",
    "short_description": "&quot;Guidelines for the Book of Changes&quot; is a guidance game based on the &quot;Book of Changes&quot; philosophy. It interprets your inner world through divination, guiding you forward with wisdom and courage, not fate. Find inner balance, strength, and your life's beacon here.",
